{"id":"msg_m_nikke_guillotine_03","cat":"messenger","group":{"id":"room_ingrid_s","label":"Ingrid · Chat"},"label":"2. Emergency","stage":null,"prev":"msg_m_nikke_poli_05","next":"msg_m_nikke_maiden_03","speakers":{"ingrid":"Ingrid"},"icons":{"ingrid":"si_c900_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_03_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"ingrid","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_03_1","text":"Emergency","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_03_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"ingrid","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_03_2","text":"A mass-produced Nikke fled towards the city","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_03_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"ingrid","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_03_3","text":"and started attacking civilians indiscriminately.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_03_4","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_03_4","text":"Was she corrupted?","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_03_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"ingrid","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_03_5","text":"Yes.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_03_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"ingrid","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_03_6","text":"Her first mission on the surface wasn't long ago.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_03_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"ingrid","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_03_7","text":"She came back severely corrupted.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_03_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"ingrid","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_03_8","text":"We had decided to discard her,","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_03_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"ingrid","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_03_9","text":"but she somehow managed to escape from the scrapyard.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_03_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"ingrid","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_03_10","text":"We'll find the supervisors responsible and hold their feet to the fire, but this incident is something we must consider in the future as well.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_03_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"ingrid","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_03_11","text":"Are you and Guillotine nearby?","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_03_12","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_03_12","text":"Yes.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_03_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"ingrid","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_03_13","text":"This is her area of expertise.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_03_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"ingrid","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_03_14","text":"I'll approve the use of her right eye.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_03_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"ingrid","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_03_15","text":"You take her and put out this fire","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_03_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"ingrid","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_03_16","text":"for the sake of our citizens.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_03_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"ingrid","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_03_17","text":"I trust you will see that this matter is resolved quickly.","jump":null}],"chat":true}